#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "WCPOS Pro – Point of Sale for WooCommerce"
msgstr "WCPOS Pro – Salgssted for WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://wcpos.com/pro"
msgstr "https://wcpos.com/pro"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"A complete Point of Sale solution for WooCommerce. Pro includes all features from the free plugin plus multi-store support, custom receipts, and more."
msgstr ""
"En komplet salgsstedsløsning til WooCommerce. Pro inkluderer alle funktioner fra den gratis plugin plus multi-butik support, tilpassede kvitteringer og mere."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "kilbot"
msgstr "kilbot"

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "http://www.kilbot.com"
msgstr "http://www.kilbot.com"

msgid "Stores"
msgstr "Butikker"

msgid "Cashiers"
msgstr "Kasserere"

msgid "Gateways"
msgstr "Gateways"

msgid "WooCommerce POS Pro is now standalone."
msgstr "WooCommerce POS Pro er nu selvstændig."

msgid ""
"The Pro plugin includes all features from the free version. You can safely deactivate and delete this plugin."
msgstr ""
"Pro-pluginet inkluderer alle funktioner fra den gratis version. Du kan sikkert deaktivere og slette denne plugin."

