msgstr "Søg i butikker"

msgid "Parent Store:"
msgstr "Overordnet butik:"

msgid "No Stores found."
msgstr "Ingen butikker fundet."

msgid "No Stores found in Trash."
msgstr "Ingen butikker fundet i papirkurven."

msgid "WCPOS Pro failed to load. Please run composer install."
msgstr "WCPOS Pro kunne ikke indlæses. Kør venligst composer install."

msgid "WCPOS Pro"
msgstr "WCPOS Pro"

msgid ""
"now includes all features from the free plugin. The standalone free plugin has been automatically deactivated. You may safely delete it from your plugins."
msgstr ""
"inkluderer nu alle funktioner fra det gratis plugin. Det selvstændige gratis plugin er blevet automatisk deaktiveret. Du kan trygt slette det fra dine plugins."
